 "id": "1076094105344259", "uri": "https://scontent-iad3-1.oculuscdn.com/v/t64.5771-25/595119480_1076094108677592_2088000046788261585_n.png?_nc_cat=110&ccb=1-7&_nc_sid=6e7a0a&_nc_ohc=AN19739G3Z0Q7kNvwHUQWUq&_nc_oc=AdoxO01EKT_5YJ8u7pQYH6HCnuhjVRBAF8Ce4GiFKu_QvM3tkH1M9osMXSIIva5q82s&_nc_zt=3&_nc_ht=scontent-iad3-1.oculuscdn.com&_nc_ss=7f20f&oh=00_AQSXwCosZ6Z_2BCjPgfQNRosyQF664dP9qUepVqHgNIe9Q&oe=6AEB3F40"}, {"file_name": "5_desert_winds_barco_volador.png", "id": "2182320879362622", "uri": "https://scontent-iad6-1.oculuscdn.com/v/t64.5771-25/491830904_2182320886029288_3055924156060172872_n.png?_nc_cat=107&ccb=1-7&_nc_sid=6e7a0a&_nc_ohc=qHf_xX_LT1IQ7kNvwGIBmUS&_nc_oc=AdpNeKgWjMjCBUCjuVAwu09eXyB5lxAUM3idhxOu1TVoR2PmAV7KCCF9vJM7KTJ5lxI&_nc_zt=3&_nc_ht=scontent-iad6-1.oculuscdn.com&_nc_ss=7f20f&oh=00_AQQk4L67IAMwyzI0Hni7Y5XL8RLgiQwvpLvPLoHUVI3Nhw&oe=6AEB3A54"}], "video_trailer": null, "video_trailer_thumbnail": {"file_name": "portada_trailer_nebulosa_FINAL.png", "id": "1060859123415115", "uri": "https://scontent-iad6-1.oculuscdn.com/v/t64.5771-25/604360590_1060859126748448_7361617755451568191_n.png?_nc_cat=106&ccb=1-7&_nc_sid=6e7a0a&_nc_ohc=TeoFzCsbezsQ7kNvwEkwjYo&_nc_oc=AdrWRhZB-DQTE8AjCCSDb83lGjfXSbHqbVFtvAO7T6J-z1YGl5gQJ-7aeXvklKKZ46M&_nc_zt=3&_nc_ht=scontent-iad6-1.oculuscdn.com&_nc_ss=7f20f&oh=00_AQRRSh4klrGjfzGlqAG0PshsoqX8-Mwq3yrFenOYipvzEw&oe=6AEB32BD"}, "display_name": "Sound Voyages VR", "keywords": ["relax", "music", "sleep", "groove", "360"], "long_description": "### Step inside the music\n\nPress play and a 360\u00b0 world wraps around you. You are not watching a music video: you are standing inside it. Every voyage pairs original music by iKRX with visuals made for VR, streamed at full quality \u2014 up to 8K at 60 fps, with the newest voyages in true stereoscopic 3D.\n\n### A new voyage every week\n120+ voyages, with a premiere every Friday. Explore Night Drive, Space Voyages, Serenity Vibes, Binaural Theta Waves and more.\n\n### Sound you can feel\nAmbient and downtempo, techno and synthwave, dark cinematic scores and songs with lyrics. Theta waves two ways: binaural beats for headphones and isochronic tones that work on speakers too.\n\n### An app that adapts to you\nA dynamic, intuitive menu, easy with your hands or controllers. Switch to tablet mode to hold it in your hands at a comfortable angle, tap with a fingertip, or look and pinch. Plus sleep timer, keep watching, favourites and subtitles in English and Spanish.\n\n### Free, with nothing in the way\nNo ads, no accounts, no purchases. One email to enter; news only if you ask. Over 1.2 million views on YouTube, now around you.\n\nStreaming notice: voyages stream from our own servers, so a good internet connection is required. The streamed content is provided by Zigra Servicios Profesionales SL and may not be available in perpetuity.\n\nHealth notice: some voyages contain flashing lights and fast camera motion. Take breaks if you are sensitive to either.\n\nsoundvoyagesvr.com \u00b7 Support: info@zigra.net", "short_description": "Step inside the music: 120+ immersive 360\u00b0 VR music videos, free, with a new voyage every week. Original music by iKRX in worlds that wrap around you, streamed at up to 8K and 60 fps, the newest in true stereoscopic 3D. Cruise neon cities at night, drift through deep space, sink into the ocean abyss. Binaural theta waves and isochronic tones for deep listening; techno and synthwave to move to. Intuitive menu with tablet mode, made for your hands. No ads, no accounts, no purchases."}]}, "developer_name": null, "developer_privacy_policy_url": "https://soundvoyagesvr.com/privacy/", "developer_terms_of_service_url": null, "publisher_name": "Zigra Servicios Profesionales SL", "support_website_url": null, "website_url": "https://soundvoyagesvr.com/", "category": null, "comfort_rating": "COMFORTABLE_FOR_SOME", "comfort_tags": [], "context_category": {"id": "362692211442873", "context_category": "APPS"}, "context_topics": [{"id": "43496192